    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2016-sekimura-papilio-wing-stripe-mimicry.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Papilio dardanus (African mocker swallowtail female mimetic morphs: hippocoonides, trophonius, cenea, planemoides) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 94.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-papilio-wing-stripe-mimicry-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
