    rdfs:label "Sekimura et al. (2000) Proc. R. Soc. B, Madzvamuse et al. (2002) J. Math. Biol. & Thompson et al. (2014) Nature anisotropic Gierer–Meinhardt butterfly wing pattern formation and Batesian mimicry polymorphism in Papilio dardanus — Reproducibility package: 94/100" ;
